WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:03.769
-Prominent Republicans are
continuing to lie

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:06.639
about the violence insurrection
at the Capitol on January 6th

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.607
while others are trying to
pretend the last year

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:10.577
of Donald Trump's
presidency never happened.

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.512
For more on this,
it's time for A Closer Look.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:16.615
♪♪

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:18.784
After a year of isolation,
it can be difficult

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:20.653
to get a firm grasp
on time.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:23.723
Quarantine felt like some sort
of "Twilight Zone"-esque

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.091
black hole.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.626
All I remember is I was in my
studio with an audience

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:30.696
then for awhile I was in an
attic with a magic door

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:32.598
and some wasps,
I became best friends

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:35.034
with a Sea Captain painting
and now I'm back here

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:36.703
in a mostly empty studio.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:39.705
And somehow last night Wally,
our cue card guy

00:00:39.705 --> 00:00:41.640
was my second guest.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.610
I don't think that's going to be
an every Wednesday thing, Wally.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.046
-I can't next Wednesday anyway.
I'm doing Colbert.

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:48.615
-Son of a bitch.

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:51.251
Anyway, it seems like the
calendar's going backwards

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:52.752
everyone's talking about
"Friends"

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:55.254
and "Benifer" and cicadas
and it really feels like

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:57.823
I accidentally time travelled
back to the mid-2000s.

00:00:57.823 --> 00:01:00.226
Even "Fox News"
seems stuck in a time loop.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.528
As evidenced by this segment
from last night.

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:04.463
-I never thought that we'd ever
have a president

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:06.999
that started his entire
political career in the home

00:01:06.999 --> 00:01:10.870
of not one but two unrepentant
domestic terrorists

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.005
who's group,
"The Weather Underground"

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:16.942
bombed the NYPD police
headquarters, State Department,

00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:18.644
the U.S. Capitol and more.

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:21.280
I never thought we would have a
president who sat in the pews

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.783
of a radical pastor
for 20-plus years

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:27.586
and I never thought we'd elect a
disciple of radical Saul Alinsky

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:32.124
or a President bragging about
doing drugs with his Choom Gang

00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:35.428
and said that he even
tried drugs enthusiastically.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.029
Great message for kids.

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:38.298
-Alright, first of all,
you sound like

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:40.233
a D.A.R.E. commercial
from the '80s.

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.768
If you kids don't remember
D.A.R.E. it was a group that

00:01:42.768 --> 00:01:46.072
made T-shirts for skateboarders
to wear ironically.

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:48.908
Seriously, you're warning about
the dangers of Choom?

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.943
I feel like I'm back in middle
school pretending to listen to

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:53.613
a motivational speaker lecture
us about how marijuana

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.381
fries your brain while I type

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.182
"boobs" on a calculator
for my friends.

00:01:57.182 --> 00:01:59.485
See, that's what's todays' kids
are missing with smart phones.

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:01.253
No more fun calculator tricks.

00:02:01.253 --> 00:02:03.622
Now you just send your friends
two chestnut emojis.

00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:05.925
We had to work for it.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:09.461
It took years to crack that
8-0-0-8-5 would look like

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:10.863
"boobs" on the calculator.

00:02:10.863 --> 00:02:13.466
And it wasn't us that cracked it
either, it was the janitor.

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:17.370
Turns out he was some kind of
genius.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.705
"Fox News" apparently still
obsessing over Obama.

00:02:19.705 --> 00:02:21.540
Now, there are some who think

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.309
we should stop
talking about President Trump.

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:24.910
But in our defense,
the Republicans still call him

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.413
the leader of their party, he's
talking about running in 2024,

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:29.749
and he's under criminal
investigation.

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:33.252
Meanwhile, most Obama news these
days is showbiz related.

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:34.653
I wouldn't be surprised
if he turns up

00:02:34.653 --> 00:02:36.055
in the "Friends" reunion.

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:39.259
[ As Obama ] No, uh, for my
money, they were on a break.

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:43.930
[ Normal voice ]
If you're wondering why Fox is
rehashing right wing nonsense,

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.165
from 13 years ago,
it's apparently because

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:49.168
"According to a book, Obama
called Trump a "madman,"

00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:52.038
a "racist, sexist pig," "that
[Bleep] lunatic"

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.272
and a "corrupt mother[bleep].

00:02:53.272 --> 00:02:55.575
That's what you're outraged
about?

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:57.910
Trump's been called much worse
and deservedly so.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:01.013
I feel like even Trump's friends
would describe him that way.

00:03:01.013 --> 00:03:04.416
Hallmark makes birthday cards
specifically for Trump

00:03:04.416 --> 00:03:06.919
that basically say the same
thing.

00:03:06.919 --> 00:03:08.687
[ As Trump ] It's from Ivanka,
such a sweetheart,

00:03:08.687 --> 00:03:09.988
a corrupt sweetheart.

00:03:09.988 --> 00:03:11.624
[ Normal voice ] I mean,
seriously, even the people

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:14.393
who worked for Trump called him
an idiot, a moron and a dope

00:03:14.393 --> 00:03:16.863
and before they sold their
souls, guys like Marco Rubio,

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:19.698
Lindsey Graham and Ted Cruz were
calling him a xenophobic

00:03:19.698 --> 00:03:21.367
race-baiting bigot,
a con artist,

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:23.268
a pathological liar,
and a jackass.

00:03:23.268 --> 00:03:25.971
Michael Cohen was his fixer and
right hand man

00:03:25.971 --> 00:03:28.141
and he said pretty much the same
in a book

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:29.509
and on national television.

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:31.877
Although Michael Cohen's best
burns these days

00:03:31.877 --> 00:03:34.580
are reserved for Rudy Giuliani's
son Andrew who's running for

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:35.715
governor of New York.

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:38.517
-And then there's
Andrew Giuliani.

00:03:38.517 --> 00:03:42.554
Andrew makes Erik look like
a Valedictorian of Harvard.

00:03:42.554 --> 00:03:49.629
I mean, you know, I think if I'm
not mistaken, you know,

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:52.197
Andrew even failed
Trump University.

00:03:52.197 --> 00:03:55.735
That's to give you an idea of
just how stupid he is.

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:58.204
-Can't believe I'm saying it,
but I think prison

00:03:58.204 --> 00:04:00.773
Was great for Michael Cohen.

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:04.109
Came out with a new attitude
and a quiver full of zingers.

00:04:04.109 --> 00:04:06.112
Got rid of that baby blue
jacket.

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.280
But hey,
he's not the only one

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.881
who seems to be stuck
in a time loop.

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:11.917
Yesterday the House GOP's new
pro-Trump conference chair

00:04:11.917 --> 00:04:13.986
Elise Stefanik who replaced
Liz Cheney

00:04:13.986 --> 00:04:16.389
after Cheney committed
the grave sin of saying

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:18.624
the election was not stolen
took to the floor

00:04:18.624 --> 00:04:20.393
to praise Trump's economic
record.

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.128
But see if you can catch
what she left out.

00:04:22.128 --> 00:04:24.363
It's so small you might miss it.

00:04:24.363 --> 00:04:29.335
-Americans across this country
are facing crisis after crisis.

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:33.005
Just think in just over a year
ago in early 2020,

00:04:33.005 --> 00:04:34.640
our economy was booming,

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.510
our standing in the world
was strong,

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:40.146
we had just rebuilt
our nation's military,

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:43.483
and our communities and families
were thriving.

00:04:43.483 --> 00:04:46.452
Here we are,
a little over one year later,

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:49.621
in just over 100 days,
President Biden

00:04:49.621 --> 00:04:53.759
and Speaker Pelosi have
dismantled that foundation.

00:04:53.759 --> 00:04:57.530
-Did she just yada yada yada
a global pandemic?

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.932
Are you people seriously so
cynical that you think

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:02.235
Americans will just forget about
an entire year

00:05:02.235 --> 00:05:04.737
which over half a million people
died, and the economy suffered

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:06.706
a once-in-a-century crash
that included

00:05:06.706 --> 00:05:08.574
rising poverty and child hunger.

00:05:08.574 --> 00:05:11.277
Because our president thought
coronavirus was one of those

00:05:11.277 --> 00:05:13.279
ignore it until it goes away
problems.

00:05:13.279 --> 00:05:15.914
[ As Trump ] It's like high
cholesterol or asbestos.

00:05:15.914 --> 00:05:17.950
[ Normal voice ] These people
are desperate to erase

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:19.485
the horrors of Trump's
presidency

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:22.888
And have an alternate reality
where it wasn't a colossal

00:05:22.888 --> 00:05:24.256
and deeply unpopular failure.

00:05:24.256 --> 00:05:27.860
And look, I get you wish Trump's
presidency magically ended

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.763
in the March of 2020 in the same
way Dexter wishes the show ended

00:05:30.763 --> 00:05:32.998
in Season 7,
but Michael C. Hall

00:05:32.998 --> 00:05:35.234
He grew that weird patchy beard
and it can't be undone.

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:36.802
They're trying to erase the
pandemic,

00:05:36.802 --> 00:05:39.171
the same way they're trying to
erase the violent insurrection

00:05:39.171 --> 00:05:41.374
at the Capitol on January 6th.

00:05:41.374 --> 00:05:44.210
GOP leaders, like Kevin McCarthy
and Mitch McConnell

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.479
are trying to stop legislation
that would create a bipartisan

00:05:47.479 --> 00:05:50.082
commission to investigate the
riot even though it passed

00:05:50.082 --> 00:05:52.718
the House yesterday with 35
Republican votes.

00:05:52.718 --> 00:05:56.355
In fact, Wisconsin said
Ron Johnson is so desperate

00:05:56.355 --> 00:05:59.025
to erase the history of what
happened on January 6th

00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:01.761
that he's still lying about the
attack and calling it

00:06:01.761 --> 00:06:03.195
"a mostly peaceful protest."

00:06:03.195 --> 00:06:06.198
-Even calling it an
insurrection, it wasn't.

00:06:06.198 --> 00:06:08.867
I condemn the breach.
I condemn the violence.

00:06:08.867 --> 00:06:13.005
To say there were thousands of
armed insurrectionists

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:16.041
breaching the Capitol intent on
overthrowing the government

00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:17.777
is just simply false narrative.

00:06:17.777 --> 00:06:21.780
By and large, it was peaceful
protest except for

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:24.550
there were a number of people
basically agitators

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:27.753
That whipped the crowd
and breached the Capitol.

00:06:27.753 --> 00:06:29.922
-We were all watching it live.
We saw it happen.

00:06:29.922 --> 00:06:32.425
You can't just wave your hand in
front of our faces

00:06:32.425 --> 00:06:34.393
and tell us it didn't happen
like you're starring

00:06:34.393 --> 00:06:37.796
in some Disney+ spin off
call "[Bleep] Jedi."

00:06:37.796 --> 00:06:40.532
There are like a bunch of videos
that you can watch

00:06:40.532 --> 00:06:41.968
and see what happens.

00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:44.169
I don't want to keep playing
them but apparently I have to.

00:06:44.169 --> 00:06:46.805
-The pro-Trump crowd fought with
the police.

00:06:46.805 --> 00:06:49.574
-This is exactly what was
feared,

00:06:49.574 --> 00:06:51.744
but in no way is this a
surprise.

00:06:51.744 --> 00:06:54.813
It has been fueled by the
president's rhetoric.

00:06:54.813 --> 00:06:58.284
-We follow the aggrieved and
infuriated Trump supporters.

00:06:58.284 --> 00:07:00.019
As they stormed the building.

00:07:00.019 --> 00:07:03.289
The cost of that rhetoric is
increasingly clear.

00:07:03.289 --> 00:07:05.925
-I know my rights!

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:09.428
-As crowds tonight are still
swirling around Congress

00:07:09.428 --> 00:07:12.364
and America's long journey as a
stable democracy

00:07:12.364 --> 00:07:14.700
appears to be in genuine doubt.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.769
-Again as we said yesterday,
the British accent

00:07:16.769 --> 00:07:18.537
really hits
home how serious it was.

00:07:18.537 --> 00:07:20.606
[ British accent ] The rioters
have breached the Capitol

00:07:20.606 --> 00:07:23.409
and like a curly whirly left out
in the sun

00:07:23.409 --> 00:07:25.911
the damaged can never be undone.

00:07:25.911 --> 00:07:29.114
And now stay tuned for an all
new episode of "Cuckoo"

00:07:29.114 --> 00:07:34.353
starring Andy Samberg from the
film "Space Chimps."

00:07:34.353 --> 00:07:37.589
[ Normal voice ] Both real.

00:07:37.589 --> 00:07:39.991
It's telling that Republicans
are so desperate to erase

00:07:39.991 --> 00:07:41.594
the last year of Trump's
presidency

00:07:41.594 --> 00:07:44.096
as well as the reality of what
happened at the Capitol

00:07:44.096 --> 00:07:45.497
on January 6th.

00:07:45.497 --> 00:07:47.833
They're trying to erase it
because they can't defend it.

00:07:47.833 --> 00:07:49.202
And they know the American
people

00:07:49.202 --> 00:07:50.536
overwhelmingly rejected it.

00:07:50.536 --> 00:07:52.471
These people are so detached
from reality,

00:07:52.471 --> 00:07:53.739
you'd almost think they'd --

00:07:53.739 --> 00:07:55.741
-Tried drugs enthusiastically.

00:07:55.741 --> 00:08:01.079
-This has been A Closer Look.

00:08:01.079 --> 00:08:02.614
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:08:02.614 --> 00:08:04.750
over 2 million meals a year
to men, women, and children

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.987
living with HIV, AIDS, cancer
and other serious illnesses.

00:08:07.987 --> 00:08:09.488
And they need your help now more
than ever.

00:08:09.488 --> 00:08:11.923
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the donate button.

00:08:11.923 --> 00:08:15.027
Stay safe. Wear a mask.
Get vaccinated. We love you.

